<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina sees wheat sowing at 6.5 mln hectares.</title>
<headline>Argentina sees wheat sowing at 6.5 mln hectares.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine farmers should sow 6.5 million hectares with 1997/98 wheat, Agriculture Secretary Felipe Sola said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Thanks to the rains over the past month we are going to be able to have a sown wheat area rather higher than what we thought two months ago,&quot; Sola told a news conference.</p>
<p>Argentine farmers sowed 7.3 million hectares with wheat last season, producing a record 16 million tonnes.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
